      "en": "Press the letter of a skill to choose whether you want to <w>practise</w> it. Skills marked with '<darkgrey>-</darkgrey>' will not be trained.",
      "zh": "按下技能对应的字母，选择是否<w>训练</w>该技能。标有'<darkgrey>-</darkgrey>'的技能不会获得训练。"
